6.	Python Programs to demonstrate different ways of creating DataFrames

Source Code:
import pandas as pd

# 1: Using Dictionary
data1 = {
    "Name": ["Kwia", "Samson"],
    "Age": [20, 25]
}
df1 = pd.DataFrame(data1)

print("DataFrame using Dictionary:")
print(df1)

# Method 2: Using List
data2 = [
    ["Kwia", 20],
    ["Samson", 25],
    ["Williams", 30]
]

df2 = pd.DataFrame(data2, columns=["Name", "Age"])

print("\nDataFrame using List:")
print(df2)

# 3: Using List of Dictionaries
data3 = [
    {"Name": "Kwia", "Age": 20},
    {"Name": "Samson", "Age": 25}
]

df3 = pd.DataFrame(data3)

print("\nDataFrame using List of Dictionaries:")

print(df3)

# 4: Using Series
data4 = {
    "Name": pd.Series(["Kwia", "Samson"]),
    "Age": pd.Series([20, 25])
}

df4 = pd.DataFrame(data4)

print("\nDataFrame using Series:")
print(df4)


